OL,3,GNEWSAMan sexually assaulted woman as
OL,4,Ashe slept on beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who sexually assaulted a woman
OL,7,Fwho had fallen asleep after a barbecue
OL,8,Fon a beach has been jailed for three
OL,9,Fyears and eight months.
OL,11,FNathan Briggs, 26, attacked the woman
OL,12,Fon Jurby Beach, in the north of the
OL,13,FIsle of Man, on 20 August 2025 after
OL,14,Fthey spent the afternoon socialising.
OL,16,FDouglas Courthouse heard the woman had
OL,17,Ffallen asleep sometime after 20:30 BST
OL,18,Fbut awoke a short time later to find
OL,19,Fhim assaulting her.
